Comment: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.40,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,已经完全是炎炎夏日了
Comment: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:08.48,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的呢
Comment: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:09.57,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,时不时会觉得空调
Comment: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:12.03,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,会吹得有点冷
Comment: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:14.12,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,穿衣服也纠结得很…
Comment: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:16.12,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,大家好像都用毯子
Comment: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.20,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,或披肩之类的
Comment: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:17.95,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,在身上披上东西
Comment: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:19.62,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,来调节适应呢
Comment: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:21.12,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,呃 我也…
Comment: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:23.25,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,以前我也这样做过
Comment: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:26.00,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 因为比较大
Comment: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.63,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,身体就完全被包裹住了…
Comment: 0,0:00:28.63,0:00:30.38,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,还可以挡风
Comment: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.47,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是挺好的吗？
Comment: 0,0:00:31.47,0:00:33.55,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,手从布料里伸出来
Comment: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:36.10,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,像幽灵一样很恐怖啊…
Comment: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:37.22,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,不过这样
Comment: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:38.77,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,也挺可爱的啊…！
Comment: 0,0:00:42.27,0:00:43.94,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,诶 这样子
Comment: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:46.73,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,不就像魔法灯里的精灵一样了…！
Comment: 0,0:00:46.73,0:00:47.90,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,哈哈！
Comment: 0,0:00:47.90,0:00:50.32,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,你说的我都能实现！
Comment: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:51.99,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,是啊
Comment: 0,0:00:51.99,0:00:55.53,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,希望篠崎先生帮忙实现的事…
Comment: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:56.91,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,想把很多的猫咪
Comment: 0,0:00:56.91,0:00:58.79,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,召唤到我跟前！
Comment: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:00.29,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,长毛的猫咪
Comment: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:02.12,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,或是短尾的猫咪
Comment: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:04.00,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,还有就是大只的猫咪
Comment: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:06.54,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,穿着袜子的那种…
Comment: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:07.50,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,然后还有…
Comment: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:08.67,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,有那么多的话
Comment: 0,0:01:08.67,0:01:10.09,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,这次会不会
Comment: 0,0:01:10.09,0:01:11.34,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,又被猫咪的身体给淹没了呢？
Comment: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:13.30,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,猫咪的话没有问题…！
